l\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's a Tempter.</div> </div> </div> </div>Probably. I did point that out as a strong possibility. Do you suppose these Assimilators could be more interesting as an Agency that has a lot of Tempters and Inquisitors with similar methods and goals? How would such an Agency function in terms of their missions and enemies? Maybe it's not a specific Agency, but a recurring category of Agencies, like Compromised, Free, Insurgent and Temporal?<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-02T01:16:34-07:00","id":1519404,"title":"","content":"You could create a completely different agenda of Demon who decide they want to become human, getting rid of all angelic aspects of their being and connection to the God machine rather than learning, destroying, rejoining the GM infrastructure.<br /> <br /> Maybe that is closest to Tempters, but i think they want to hold onto power and their version of Hell isn't just the material world.<br /> <br /> This would work for individual characters, not sure a whole agenda makes much sense. Though it overlaps heavily with Promethean (which i haven't read).<br /> <br /> Assimilators are very similar to Tempters, now that i re-read about them, but again presumably only one gets to be the new God-Machine, so how would they work as an agenda (apart from lying to each other) it could well he a sub-adgenda of Tempters who have some integrate tendencies.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27248-orathaic","name":"orathaic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27248_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1032"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-02T15:26:12-07:00","id":1519515,"title":"","content":"In the &quot;Demon the Descent - Interface&quot; There's actually a 5th INCARNATION: The &quot;Analysts&quot; Basically it's like &quot;You go there, you study and measure and sample and report back&quot;. Don't know if that provides any help, but I thought I'd drop it in here for you guys.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28143-firestar001","name":"firestar001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}